{"job_id":"F-d72b0ba3a65895edd322","family_id":"F-d72b0ba3a65895edd322","title":"지방교육행정기관에 두는 국가공무원의 정원 중 고위공무원단 직위의 직무등급의 표시 등에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":53,"target_id":"198dfba623998025bf26f9ec490eb165ca906f67848797ceeafcb86b41472b97","source_hash":"b6b4a95faaa9b140ccd2c296a1f6443f536d2776084444cae6750467e6fbbfed","text":"关于地方教育行政机构高级公务员名额中职级等职称标明的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":154,"target_id":"2033c31fdd73bed0be0059d9ce0d5a19ca7d7c668d6072622f599108b01fa5a0","source_hash":"dc9fc4bf777d57241e21e3722962b5549a8d0c22aeec6acbbea425fded79e582","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是按照《地方教育行政机构和各级公立学校国家公务员编制规定》的规定，规定地方教育行政机构国家公务员编制中高级公务员职级的标明事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":154,"end":285,"target_id":"fec986753ba8bd4f14b4f1bd5bd3d125c7b7fe86f916c71d4463664c1fa523e1","source_hash":"2de02a6cfa55658c69b297ff77a2ca87181090bcb153a9378fa62558274a8764","text":"第二条（属于高级公务员的一般公务员职级）地方教育行政机构设立的职位中，根据《地方教育行政机构组织和人员配备标准等规定》附件三规定属于高级公务员的一般公务员职级，按附表规定执行。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":285,"end":328,"target_id":"523bae4935dc8096058cada67333bffe2aa7460ddc26d3496531270b1416fcc9","source_hash":"ce57e283fcb73e84243028070ae2f0bc4778e0a917f9f94dcd18ce2a9e6fa46e","text":"补充规定 <第888号，2006年7月14日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":328,"end":378,"target_id":"9cf195fa8062cc7944dc214eae6f30fc8c866eab6c08d269e8f38be291854dbf","source_hash":"08a0dac87dd4be2fe97a0d87e72653ba8b0f07760189f59a27bfb34bdfa5c047","text":"补充条款 <第921号，2007年12月31日>\n\n该规定自2008年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":378,"end":425,"target_id":"ba5d65bd5f009ca39793212ef2f01530d4266927aafcda355b0d75045c5cde6b","source_hash":"8a94cd1730b141b0d12358964d3be741a004e3d181fa4d1f3161220333721a78","text":"增编（教育部、科学技术部及其附属机构组织结构实施细则）<2008年12月31日第24号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":425,"end":461,"target_id":"d2e34ddff3359d82247be9d9ab457a726a4d2b4e39d09b46f9ae681c2a4150ef","source_hash":"53052d208c204533532581bfd7a6e04a15ac8c57efb4df723ae9185d89443bb7","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2009年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":461,"end":639,"target_id":"aaf35447671bae5358d4eed008b2e71e9c8426f7a6c8d7dd5e64b4707e3f64ea","source_hash":"972c9435e66b6227cd04a7e3ce977399e95c7611e49eed9509006ec1aacb1539","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至⑦ 省略\n\n  ⑧ 对地方教育行政机关国家公务员名额中高级公务员职级等的标示规定作如下部分修改。 \n\n  将星号所在等级栏中的“B级”改为“A级”，并将“D级”和“E级”分别改为“B级”。\n\n  ⑨ 和 ⑩ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":639,"end":688,"target_id":"c049f26f0ec17402766d62252de2565d1499bdb0b8bc9cef85a447f034d3d3c5","source_hash":"2503b60523c2f783dcace79bfc6a438d7cb981cae56054242103c061ac7d886c","text":"补充规定 <第151号，2012年6月26日>\n\n该规定自2012年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"BODY","start":688,"end":2439,"target_id":"1ab0442f50419f574e401f4742ac9660df357fde666b68aea3533314c67d4d9d","source_hash":"9e19b985d8e18a819e39d8ccc0dc5670e1f474ef8224b02bb00a6eb3cf3ef9bd","text":"补充规定 <第385号，2026年6月30日>\n\n本规则将于2026年7月1日生效。\n\n属于高级公务员队伍的一般公务员职位职级（与第二条有关）\n■ 地方教育行政机构中国家公务员编制内高级公务员的职责等  \n\n  类别指定规则等[附表]<2026年6月30日修订>                         \n\n  高级公务员一般公务员职位职级（与第二条有关）   \n\n┌────────────┬────────┬───────────────┐\n\n│类别│职位│等级│\n\n├────────────┼────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│首尔市教育厅│副督学│A级│\n\n│                        ├────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│ │规划部主任│B级 │\n\n├────────────┼────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│全南光州综合都市教育厅│第一副督学│甲级 │\n\n│                        ├────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│                        │제2부교육감     │가등급                        │\n\n│                        ├────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│ │规划部主任│B级 │\n\n├────────────┼────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│釜山广域市教育厅│副督学│B级│\n\n├────────────┼────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│大邱广域市教育厅│副督学│B级│\n\n├────────────┼────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│仁川广域市教育厅│副督学│B级│\n\n├────────────┼────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│大田广域市教育厅│副督学│B级│\n\n├────────────┼────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│蔚山广域市教育厅│副督学│B级│\n\n├────────────┼────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│世宗市特别自治市教育厅│副督学│B级│\n\n├────────────┼────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│京畿道教育厅│第一副督学│B级│\n\n│                        ├────────┼───────────────┤\n\n│ │第二副督察 │B级 │\n\n"},{"id":"A35674-zh-00001","doc":"A35674","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2600999","source_hash":"b58ade8420e0cad8ea2871ce0582e459ef316e05371adcc80f308cd92264b135","text":"■ 地方教育行政机构中国家公务员编制内高级公务员的职责等"},{"id":"A35674-zh-00002","doc":"A35674","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2601000","source_hash":"e1c30e4268db45f0a3aff50ea486bb9316511a11f1d3ed49e264ce60ceb6cc5d","text":"START课程评分等规则[附表]<2026年6月30日修订>"},{"id":"A35674-zh-00003","doc":"A35674","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2601001","source_hash":"aa204bc11bef2e7219f5ffc831d2c25ba42dc0f40cf8606573f691d6f034abbb","text":"授予属于高级公务员队伍的普通公务员的职位职级（与第2条有关）"},{"id":"A35674-zh-00004","doc":"A35674","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2601002","source_hash":"d8ba487317ac4e370c544ff11fee92077c5dfe235d14d8d93e213e278685f7be","text":"分类MTQ29f13724665d54a300119结束"},{"id":"A35674-zh-00005","doc":"A35674","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2601003","source_hash":"a671c8c8aa32f34c8ccbd788ebed7082e308c8cdf1a68bc25823914a8aaa2cc1","text":"位置"},{"id":"A35674-zh-00006","doc":"A35674","law_id":"kr-010254-287749-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2